      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes. Framework side, if config decoding 10-bit color format on a 8-bit source, decoder will fail decoding. A better solution will be checking bit depth metadata, however framework currently doesn\u0027t have this key. So an alternative solution is using RGBA_1010102 color format specially for 10-bit heif source.\n\nI tried treehugger with this change, and it passed.",
